"P2836902759" "As you look over a melted black candle you recall the ritual you performed to exorcise <color deepskyblue>the Ghost in the Machine</color>.<br><br>Aaaaah, a virus, I mean, a ghost, ahhhhh!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2048122757" "I know you're probably itching to catch Arachnos red handed in some devious plot, or scout out the obscure inner workings of this station, but we've got a laundry list of repairs that needed to be completed yesterday. We need every available person to lend a hand in getting this place ship shape, and you are no exception. So what do you say? Do you want to lend a hand?"
// AcceptString :
"P3972892972" "Lend a Hand."
// SendOffString :
"P1621779443" "Great! I've got some <color red>malignant code</color> mucking up the systems for the customs computer. It could be an Arachnos virus, but I'm not jumping to any conclusions.<br><br><color orange>I need you to acquire some circuit boards to replace the infected ones, that should isolate the virus and purge the system.</color><br><br>You'll need to find some suitable boards from somewhere, maybe back planet side, our supply situation up here is abysmal."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P943749273" "Replace The Boards"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2345455152" "The funding for this operation is a joke. Have you gotten those boards installed yet?"
// TaskTitle :
"P4014090330" "<color deepskyblue>Ghost In The Machine</color>"
// TaskSubTitle :
"P2770291627" "<color deepskyblue>Part One</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1242460105" "Scrounging up some circuit boards shouldn't be too tough, now what was that product number again?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2320450590" "You've installed the new circuit boards. Report back to Monty."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P439082437" "All finished? Good. Let me just do a sector reboot and ensure that the system is... wait, what's going on?!<br><br>I'm locked out! This is not good, {HeroName}, the virus is still in the system and now it's starting to lock down consoles. It's almost like it's retaliating against our attempt to remove it from the system.<br><br>We're going to have to do this the hard way."
// RandomFameString :
"P1752271370" "I heard a virus has infected the space station and they might have to evacuate."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1570820250" "<color orange>I need you to go down to the central mainframe and patch into the a main console.</color> From there I need you to hack the system, try to unlock some of the consoles up here, and see if we can't purge the virus directly."
// AcceptString :
"P20768994" "Hack the mainframe."
// SendOffString :
"P2859893342" "I'll be in communication with you to help walk you through it, but you're going to "
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1669112678" "Hack The Mainframe"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2023716128" "We still don't have access to the consoles up here. Have you hacked into the system yet?"
// TaskSubTitle :
"P437020894" "<color deepskyblue>Part Two</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P512963943" "Doing computer maintenance 200 miles over the earth in zero gravity. Priceless."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1480682571" "You've made contact with an artificial intelligence. Report back to Monty."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2466408171" "Artificial Intelligence? Here? But that's impossible!<br><br>This station is almost fifty years old, it hasn't been occupied for decades, there is no way an Artificial Intelligence could have been developed that long ago.<br><br>We need a professional."
// RandomFameString :
"P856364347" ""

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3588303378" "Before we jump to conclusions I want the opinion of an expert. <color orange>I want you to head down to Steel Canyon and talk to Positron</color>. If anyone can help us out it's him."
// AcceptString :
"P1690423728" "Talk to Positron"
// SendOffString :
"P4063522688" "I'm not discounting what you are saying, {HeroName}, it's just that I'm shocked to encounter an AI imbedded within the systems of this relic of a space station. Positron is a wizard when it comes to things like this, hopefully he can lend us a hand."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P2967923603" "<color deepskyblue>Part Three</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission3_Part1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1624412984" "Talk to Positron."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1599308547" "Go talk to Positron, he'll figure out a way to shut down this AI."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P251832682" "<color deepskyblue>Ghost In The Machine<br>Part Four</color><br><br>Monty Greene told me that you would be visiting, {HeroName}. He also told me that you have evidence of an Artificial Intelligence embedded within the computer systems of the station. I must admit, it was that last bit that caught my interest enough to agree to meet with you, I am, after all, a very busy man.<br><br>Let's just take a look at the data you've gathered. Just one moment.<br><br>Hmmmm. This is... fascinating!<br><br>According to my scans this isn't an Artificial Intelligence or a virus, {HeroName}. It's a ghost!<br><br>I can't help you in this matter, {HeroName}. While I am working on several methods for manipulating spiritual energy to help a friend of mine from an insubstantial predicament, my current level of expertise over the metaphysical realm is insufficient to be of assistance to you at this juncture.<br><br><color orange>You should talk to Montague Castanella at Steel Canyon University.</color> Montague has been an invaluable resource to me in my quest to understand the metaphysical world, I'm sure he will provide you with the answers you seek."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission3_Part2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3803403168" "Talk to Montague Castanella"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2027918475" "Go to Steel Canyon University and talk to Montague. He is a lexicon for information about the spiritual world."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P222159946" "<color deepskyblue>Ghost In The Machine<br>Part Five</color><br><br>Very interesting story, {HeroName}. I know precisely how you would go about extracting this ghost from the machine. Soul Crystals.<br><br>Unfortunately, you've been beaten to the punch. The only soul crystal we had was stolen from one of our archives by an Arachnos operative only a few hours ago. It would seem that the ghost you have discovered in the station computers is also of great interest to Arachnos.<br><br>I'm uncertain if Arachnos is merely seeking to prevent the ghost's extraction, or if they seek to do it themselves.<br><br>The crystal that Arachnos stole is already home to a powerful and destructive entity, but that is a matter for the Midnight Squad to deal with. Some of our best members are already on the case<br><br>For your dilemma, however, I would suggest you head into Oranbega to seek out Shalar of the Circle of Thorns and acquire one of his soul crystals and a ritual of binding. That's how the Midnight Squad came to possess, albeit briefly, a soul crystal of our own.<br><br><color orange>Once you have acquired a soul crystal and a ritual of binding from Shalar and the Circle of Thorns, return to me and I will instruct you in their proper use.</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission3_Part3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P649665416" "Get Crystal and Ritual"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P278599138" "It would appear that your foray into Oranbega has yet to yield the reagents necessary to perform the ritual. Keep trying, new doors to Oranbega open every day."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P635647809" "You get the feeling that Shalar and the Circle know you are coming. Perhaps it's the sound of spells being prepared and shouting voices echoing down the corridors ahead."

