"P2576342772" "Return to Montague Castanella"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3016330225" "I don't know what to do with this crystal, {HeroName}. I sent you to Positron for technical support and you come back with magic rocks! Has Positron lost his marbles?<br><br>Montague put you up to this? From the Midnight Squad? Well, I'd talk to him if I were you, cause I don't know the first thing about this juju stuff."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3336359918" "<color deepskyblue>Ghost In The Machine<br>Part Six</color><br><br>Excellent job, {HeroName}! I trust Shalar and his daemons didn't put up too much of a fight.<br><br>I've prepared these instructions for you to perform the ritual of binding with the soul crystal and the ghost in the machine."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P359817306" "You're going to perform an exorcism? So wait, the Artificial Intelligence is actually a ghost in the machine?<br><br>They don't pay me enough for this..."
// RandomFameString :
"P1086888579" "I heard that computers viruses are actually evil spirits."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2478396712" "All the information you've provided is solid enough for me to okay this operation, I just hope Positron and Montague are right about this. <color orange>Head down to the mainframe and extract the ghost, {HeroName}.</color> There's no time to lose."
// AcceptString :
"P2905344991" "Extract the Ghost"
// SendOffString :
"P2632742381" "If the ghost doesn't want to come quietly I can cut power to the area to prevent it from disengaging any safety measures. I'll keep an eye on you and if things get bad I'm pulling the plug for the sake of everyone else on board.<br><br>Good luck, {HeroName}."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1476102474" "Have you performed the ritual yet?"
// TaskSubTitle :
"P1224468182" "<color deepskyblue>Finale</color>"

