// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1432060167" "If it wasn't for the fact that you are about to conduct an ancient ritual to trap an angry spirit in a crystal, then the whole candle lit view of space would be kinda romantic."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2047587383" "You've done it! You extracted the ghost from the machine!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2735128741" "It's amazing, {HeroName}! After you finished the ritual my console rebooted and a file was found in my e-mail. The file was the crew bio for one of the original engineers on the station who died during the construction. His name was Ivan Krylov. I think he was the ghost in the machine!"

